Muqo
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
WUDI 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
WUDI 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
WUDI 7 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
